  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "dsh-x",
      "text": "DeepSeek Harness 插件套件。目前提供一项功能：删除会话。"
    },
    {
      "section": "安装",
      "text": "**客户端**：打开「插件」→「添加插件」，填入\n`https://github.com/Linzzz14/dsh-x`。\n\n**CLI，从仓库安装**：\n\n```bash\ndsh plugin --profile web add github:Linzzz14/dsh-x\n```\n\n**CLI，从发布包安装**：\n\n```bash\ndsh plugin --profile web add https://github.com/Linzzz14/dsh-x/releases/latest/download/dsh-x.tgz\n```\n\n如果装完没有生效，尝试重启客户端。"
    },
    {
      "section": "删除会话",
      "text": "> ⚠️ 删除不可恢复，并会连带删除该会话的子会话。\n\n会话行「…」菜单的最后一项，点击后弹出与原生「删除工作区」相同的确认框。\n\n<img src=\"docs/images/delete-session.webp\" width=\"360\" alt=\"会话菜单中的「删除会话」\">\n\n删除会清理：\n\n- 这个会话本身，以及它在磁盘上的全部记录\n- 由它派生的所有子会话\n- 它在工作区中的记录（所属、置顶、归档）\n- 相关缓存和备份；项目文件夹变空时一并移除\n\n附件不会删除——它们被多个会话共用，单独删除可能影响其他会话。正在运行的会话不能删。"
    },
    {
      "section": "许可",
      "text": "[MIT](LICENSE)"
    },
    {
      "section": "dsh-x",
      "text": "A DeepSeek Harness plugin suite. One feature so far: delete a session."
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "**Client**: open **Plugins** → **Add plugin** and enter\n`https://github.com/Linzzz14/dsh-x`.\n\n**CLI, from the repository**:\n\n```bash\ndsh plugin --profile web add github:Linzzz14/dsh-x\n```\n\n**CLI, from a release package**:\n\n```bash\ndsh plugin --profile web add https://github.com/Linzzz14/dsh-x/releases/latest/download/dsh-x.tgz\n```\n\nIf it does not take effect, restart the client."
    },
    {
      "section": "Delete a session",
      "text": "> ⚠️ Deletion is permanent, and it also removes the session's sub-sessions.\n\nThe last item of the session row \"…\" menu. It opens the same confirmation dialog as\nthe native *Delete workspace* action.\n\n<img src=\"docs/images/delete-session.webp\" width=\"420\" alt=\"Delete session in the session row menu\">\n\nDeleting removes:"
    },
    {
      "section": "Delete a session",
      "text": "- the session itself and all of its records on disk\n- every sub-session it created\n- its entry in the workspace (membership, pin, archive)\n- related caches and backups; a project folder that becomes empty is removed too\n\nAttachments are kept — they are shared by several sessions, so deleting them from one\nsession could affect the others. Sessions that are still running cannot be deleted."
    },
    {
      "section": "License",
      "text": "[MIT](LICENSE)"
    }
